#set page(paper: "a4", margin: 24mm)
#set text(font: "Libertinus Serif", size: 11pt)
#set par(leading: 0.65em)

= A quiet space to write

Good writing begins with a little room to think.

Sumi keeps your words close and the tools you need within reach.
Start with an idea. The page will take shape as you go.

== Begin with one sentence

Write down what is on your mind. You do not need to organize everything
at once, or remember every command. Press *⌘J* to discover a useful tool.

- Use headings to trace an idea
- Use images and tables to explain a detail
- Use an equation to express a simple relationship

$ E = m c^2 $

== See the finished page

Switch to the side-by-side preview to see your writing on the page.
Every edit becomes part of the finished document.

